      "challengeTier": "foundation",
      "prompt": {
        "zh-Hant": "若 (x^2 - 3x + 1)(2x^2 + ax - 4) 展開後不含 x^3 項，求 a。",
        "zh-Hans": "若 (x^2 - 3x + 1)(2x^2 + ax - 4) 展开后不含 x^3 项，求 a。",
        "en": "If the expansion of (x^2 - 3x + 1)(2x^2 + ax - 4) has no x^3 term, find a.",
        "ja": "(x^2 - 3x + 1)(2x^2 + ax - 4) を展開したとき x^3 の項がないなら、a を求めなさい。"
      },
      "answer": {
        "zh-Hant": "答案是 6。",
        "zh-Hans": "答案是 6。",
        "en": "The answer is 6.",
        "ja": "答えは 6 です。"
      },
      "solutionSteps": {
        "zh-Hant": [
          "x^3 項來自 x^2·ax 和 (-3x)·2x^2。",
          "它們的係數和是 a - 6。",
          "因為沒有 x^3 項，所以 a - 6 = 0。",
          "因此 a = 6。"
        ],
        "zh-Hans": [
          "x^3 项来自 x^2·ax 和 (-3x)·2x^2。",
          "它们的系数和是 a - 6。",
          "因为没有 x^3 项，所以 a - 6 = 0。",
          "因此 a = 6。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "The x^3 terms come from x^2·ax and (-3x)·2x^2.",
          "Their total coefficient is a - 6.",
          "Set a - 6 = 0 because the x^3 term vanishes.",
          "So a = 6."
        ],
        "ja": [
          "x^3 の項は x^2·ax と (-3x)·2x^2 から出ます。",
          "係数の和は a - 6 です。",
          "x^3 の項がないので a - 6 = 0。",
          "したがって a = 6。"
        ]
      },
