        "en": "Define an operation by x@y = ax - by + 4, where a and b are constants. Given 1@2 = 0 and 2@(-1) = 11, find 3@2.",
        "ja": "演算 x@y = ax - by + 4 を定めます。ただし a, b は定数です。1@2 = 0、2@(-1) = 11 のとき、3@2 を求めなさい。"
      },
      "answer": {
        "zh-Hant": "答案是 4。",
